# Perfil "https" (padrão do VS / F5):
@host = https://localhost:7181
# Perfil "http" (dotnet run --launch-profile http): troque para
# @host = http://localhost:5119
@salesUrl = {{host}}/api/sales

### Create a sale
# item "Beer" qty 5  -> 10% discount ; item "Soda" qty 12 -> 20% discount
POST {{salesUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "saleNumber": "SALE-1001",
  "saleDate": "2026-08-26T10:00:00Z",
  "customerId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "customerName": "ACME Ltda",
  "branchId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "branchName": "Sao Paulo",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333", "productName": "Beer", "quantity": 5, "unitPrice": 100.00 },
    { "productId": "44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444", "productName": "Soda", "quantity": 12, "unitPrice": 10.00 }
  ]
}

### List sales (paging + filtering + ordering) - convencao do .doc/general-api.md
# o espaco em "_order" precisa ser %20 senao o runner nao reconhece a request
GET {{salesUrl}}?_page=1&_size=10&isCancelled=false&_order=totalAmount%20desc,%20saleNumber%20asc

### List sales - filtro por intervalo de data
GET {{salesUrl}}?_minDate=2026-01-01&_maxDate=2026-12-31&_order=saleDate%20desc

### Get a sale by id
GET {{salesUrl}}/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Update a sale (replaces header data and items)
PUT {{salesUrl}}/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "saleDate": "2026-08-27T09:00:00Z",
  "customerId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "customerName": "ACME S.A.",
  "branchId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "branchName": "Campinas",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "55555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555555", "productName": "Water", "quantity": 4, "unitPrice": 25.00 }
  ]
}

### Cancel a single item (raises ItemCancelled)
POST {{salesUrl}}/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/items/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/cancel

### Cancel the whole sale (raises SaleCancelled)
POST {{salesUrl}}/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/cancel

### Delete a sale
DELETE {{salesUrl}}/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
